#Front page of the Party newspaper.

    <img class="news-masthead" src="img/berliner_tageblatt-removebg-preview.png">

 [? if year = 1919 and month = 2: The Republic is barely three months old. Out of revolution, mutiny, and the Kaiser's abdication, we have built something never seen before in german history, a republic. We are currently one of the three founding parties part of the Weimar Coalition of the SPD, the Centre, and ourselves. ?]

 [? if year = 1919 and month = 2: But the peace with the Allies has not yet been made, the country is still recovering from a war that broke its economy, and armed men who never demobilized still roam the streets under nobody's firm control. Now, the task of social liberalism is to draft a constitution, make peace with the entente and rebuild the economy.  ?]

    <img class="news-emblem" src="img/weimar_republic_icon.png">
